    1→# Monaco Editor
    …
    8→The Monaco Editor is the fully featured code editor from [VS Code](https://github.com/microsoft/vscode). Check out the [VS Code docs](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editor/editingevolved) to see some of the supported features.
    10→![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/5047891/94183711-290c0780-fea3-11ea-90e3-c88ff9d21bd6.png)
    12→## Try it out
    14→Try out the editor and see various examples [in our interactive playground](https://microsoft.github.io/monaco-editor/playground.html).
    16→The playground is the best way to learn about how to use the editor, which features is supports, to try out different versions and to create minimal reproducible examples for bug reports.
